{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">華潤醫藥上半年多賺約半成，純利有21.8億元人民幣。中期息每股8.7分人民幣，按年增加逾兩成。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">期內，收入1,344億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-25T00:59:08.530917+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":64,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}